{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuAmd7kCdSTxfg7fkKD7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've built the dashboard and created the alert rule, and both now exist in Kibana. I haven't opened the dashboard to check the panels render, and the rule hasn't run yet: Kibana reports it as \"pending\".\n\n**1. What the data holds.** The data view `Kibana Sample Data Logs` (index `kibana_sample_data_logs`, time field `timestamp`) has one document per web request. Each one records:\n- the client IP (`clientip`) and the requested `url`, `request` and file `extension`\n- the HTTP `response` code, stored as text (with an exact-match `response.keyword` copy)\n- `bytes` transferred\n- the source and destination country (`geo.src`, `geo.dest`) and coordinates\n- the `agent` and `machine.os`\n- `host`, `referer` and `tags`\n\n**2. Dashboard: \"EFF-ba215465 Web logs overview\"** has 7 panels. Its id is `eff-ba215465-web-logs-overview-ae7e776207af` and it opens at http://localhost:15601/app/dashboards#/view/eff-ba215465-web-logs-overview-ae7e776207af\n- Three single-number panels: total requests, unique visitors (counted by client IP) and total bytes served.\n- A bar chart of requests over time, split by the five most common response codes.\n- A pie chart of each response code's share of requests.\n- A table of the top 10 URLs, with request count and average bytes.\n- A bar chart of the top 10 source countries.\n\n**3. Rule: \"EFF-ba215465 5xx spike\"** (id `7f92144d-d30e-46a9-9d91-4162ca93cbe3`)\n- It is an Elasticsearch query rule on `kibana_sample_data_logs` that runs every minute.\n- It counts requests whose response code starts with \"5\" and fires when more than 10 arrive within 5 minutes.\n- I created it already switched on. Kibana's default is off, and an off rule would never fire.\n- It has no notification connector attached, so firing records an alert in Kibana but sends no message anywhere."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":641,"cache_read_input_tokens":20794,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":641},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0536cbf5-c97a-5467-80bd-e50c5d30a2ce","uuid":"29dbbe18-e382-4611-bafc-d60d1d310de1","timestamp":"2026-10-10T20:14:33.264Z","request_id":"req_011CfuAmcw5AmPJoirSxuTjr"}
